{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff3478d0-2573-86c0-be10-202db028ef8a",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T15:05:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniel Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:02:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:02:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I have an old appliance I need hauled away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:02:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What kind of appliance is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:02:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A washer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A washing machine, got it. And is it out at the curb already, or still inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Inside. [pause] Sorry, I'm on a bus."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I can hear it. Let me know if I'm breaking up on your end. Where's the pickup, what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "137 Dean Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "137 Dean Avenue, in the Fifth Ward. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:18-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So generally, large items like a washer aren't picked up with the regular trash. They usually need to be set up as a separate bulk pickup, and sometimes there's a requirement for appliances, like removing the door. Have you ever scheduled one before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:36-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:37-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm going to have to check on the exact process for appliances, because it can depend on whether it has refrigerant or not. A washer shouldn't, but I want to confirm. Is it a washer only, no dryer or anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the washer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:03:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, just the washer. [pause] Are you still there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[line breaks up] Yeah. Bumpy road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Today's a bad day to be out, with that rain coming down, too. Crews are going to be stretched with the weather, so I wouldn't put the washer outside yet. It'd just sit in the wet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can a supervisor call me back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can have a supervisor call you. Is there something specific you want them to go over, so I can put it in the note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How to get the washer picked up. And when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Appliance pickup, how and when, for a washing machine at 137 Dean Avenue. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:48-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:49-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0163. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:53-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And it's Daniel? Can you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daniel Abdi. A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:05:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Daniel Abdi, A-B-D-I. Perfect. Any time of day that's better for a call, since you're on the move?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:05:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:05:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After five. I'll note that. I'll get this over to a supervisor and they should reach you later today or early next week, depending on how the storm goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:05:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:05:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Daniel. Stay dry out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T15:05:29-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye."
    }
  ],
